abstract: >-
  Code, archived scientific inputs and documentation reproducing the figures,
  tables and statistics of a comparative analysis of human HLA and swine SLA MHC
  protein sequences, their protein-language-model projection, eplet-associated
  position agreement, and structural comparison.
